---
import Base from "../layouts/Base.astro";
import { education, experience } from "../data/experience";
const timeline = experience.filter((x) => x.group !== "Additional experience");
---

<Base
  title="About — Ivan Minier"
  theme="about"
  description="Public Communication student, independent product builder, and founder of Tideframe Labs in Vermont."
>
  <section class="about-opening wrap-wide">
    <div>
      <p class="eyebrow">About Ivan</p>
      <h1>Making things clear is a kind of care.</h1>
      <div class="about-aside">
        <strong>{education.school}</strong>
        <p>
          {education.program}
          <br />
          {education.department}
          <br />
          {education.date}
          <br />
          {education.prior}
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div>
      <p class="lede">
        I'm Ivan Minier, a Public Communication student at the University of
        Vermont and the founder of Tideframe Labs.
      </p>
      <p>
        I work across writing, design, and software. Sometimes the result is a
        Mac utility. Sometimes it's a guided rental record or an independent
        housing concept. I like finding a structure that helps someone
        understand what to do next.
      </p>
      <p>
        That interest extends beyond products. I've helped promote campus
        programs, served conference guests, and worked in dining and household
        care. Each setting asks for attention to people, context, and the
        details that make an experience work.
      </p>
      <p>
        Lately the work has turned toward the built environment. I want to
        become a residential real estate developer — multifamily, student
        housing, and mixed-use — involved from the first vision through design,
        feasibility, construction, and leasing. My independent{" "}
        <a href="/work/trinity-redistricting">Trinity Redistricting</a> proposal
        and the design studies I'm developing from it are where I'm learning that
        process. I'm a student exploring the field, not a licensed architect,
        planner, or developer.
      </p>
      <p>
        My software work includes AI-assisted development. I direct the product
        and interface, organize the content, and take responsibility for
        reviewing what I publish.
      </p>
      <a class="text-link" href="/tideframe">
        The studio chapter ↗
      </a>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="section wrap-wide">
    <p class="eyebrow">Experience & leadership</p>
    <h2>
      Work with people,
      <br />
      as well as pixels.
    </h2>
    <div class="timeline">
      {timeline.map((x) => (
        <article class="timeline-entry">
          <time>{x.date}</time>
          <div>
            <h3>{x.role}</h3>
            <p>
              <strong>{x.organization}</strong>
            </p>
            <p>{x.details.join(" ")}</p>
          </div>
        </article>
      ))}
    </div>
    <a class="text-link" href="/resume">
      Full résumé & capabilities ↗
    </a>
  </section>
</Base>
